    "text": "<p>Given: </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></munderover><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now, applying Newton Leibnitz Theorem we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p> And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mn>13</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>219</mn></math></p>",
